    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0305","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Tenzin Eriksdóttir talks about negative space and its landlord. The artist insists the recording itself is the artwork and that we are now co-authors.</Description>
